<title>USA: Colgate-Palmolive Co Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Colgate-Palmolive Co Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.12		    $0.95</p>
<p> Net			169,600		  143,500</p>
<p> Net Sales	    2,147,100		2,053,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 147,300		  146,100</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share and avg shrs are on a pre-split basis. A 2-for-1 split is to take effect May 15, 1997. On a post-split basis, the company earned $0.56 a share vs $0.47.</p>
<p>Assuming full dilution, pre-split EPS were $1.04 vs $0.89.</p>
</text>
